CORE
main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ call after the trait: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
elaborate_class_template stopped at the second enclosing instantiation of
the same template (same_template_depth >= 2) unless the arguments converge;
the bound is now 3.  It is a heuristic against runaway recursion: 4 made
cpp17_headers1 ten times slower, 8 made it time out.  g++ 13 and clang++ 18
accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
